                                "sense_id": "4e17e15f-e018-3d1d-97af-1356209534a2",
                                "text": "Agenten snapten de kersverse automobilist en pakten zijn rijbewijs af. Bovendien kreeg de snelheidsduivel een flinke boete.",
                                "translation": "Officers nabbed the brand-new motorist and took away his driving licence. In addition, the speeder received a hefty fine.",
